\u003e west face plane x=2.545\\n   LIGHT seat box   RGB~(111,116,124) u400-459: bottom edge y 5.93..6.27, x 2.64..3.71          =\\u003e south/front face\\n   (u344 bottom y=9.47 \\u003e north wall -\\u003e occlusion noise, dropped; u400,u416-456 v=306 is the TOP edge not ground, dropped)\\n =\\u003e sofa_1 FOOTPRINT x 2.54..3.71, y 6.00..7.62  =\\u003e CENTER (3.12, 6.80) size ~1.17 x 1.62. Tall back on WEST side.\\n OLD sofa_1 (2.48,6.67) was the back-panel edge, not the center. UPDATE to (3.12,6.80) conf 0.85.\\n SAME FRAME confirms two more, independently:\\n   floor_lamp_1 base bottoms u24-64 -\\u003e x -2.69..-2.26, y 5.77..6.00  =\\u003e keep (-2.45,5.85) conf 0.92\\n   stool_1 legs  u114-166 v372/389 -\\u003e x -1.11..-0.65, y 5.24..5.68   =\\u003e keep (-0.90,5.45) conf 0.92\\n   brown stool TOP u112-173 v325-345 is an ELEVATED disc (z~0.45), not ground -\\u003e ignore its back-projection.\\n GREEN blobs u395-511 bottom v459-511: elevated leaves; at z=0.6 they back-project to ~(1.28,3.20) = potted_plant_1. No new object.\\n INVENTORY STAYS 8.\\nEOF\\ncat \\u003e /tmp/k.py \\u003c\\u003c'EOF'\\nimport numpy as np, math\\nfrom PIL import Image\\na=np.array(Image.open('/work/observations/obs_0110.png').convert('RGB')).astype(int)\\nR,G,B=a[:,:,0],a[:,:,1],a[:,:,2]\\ncx,cy,h=0.549,1.520,45.0\\nF=(math.sin(math.radians(h)),math.cos(math.radians(h)))\\nRt=(math.cos(math.radians(h)),-math.sin(math.radians(h)))\\ndef bp(u,v,z=0.0):\\n    D=(1.55-z)*256./(v-256.); L=D*(u-256)/256.\\n    return round(cx+D*F[0]+L*Rt[0],3), round(cy+D*F[1]+L*Rt[1],3)\\n# cream/tan cabinet: light warm, R\\u003eG\\u003eB, bright\\ncab=(R\\u003e170)\\u0026(R\\u003c235)\\u0026(R-B\\u003e12)\\u0026(R-B\\u003c45)\\u0026(G\\u003cR)\\u0026(G\\u003eR-20)\\nys,xs=np.nonzero(cab)\\nprint('cab u',xs.min(),xs.max(),'v',ys.min(),ys.max(),'n',len(xs))\\nfor u in range(xs.min(),xs.max()+1,6):\\n    c=np.nonzero(cab[:,u])[0]; c=c[c\\u003e258]\\n    if len(c): print('  ',u,'top',int(c.min()),'bot',int(c.max()),bp(u,int(c.max())))\\nEOF\\npython3 /tmp/k.py 2\\u003e/dev/null | head -40\"}"}},{"type":"content_block_stop","index":2},{"type":"message_delta","delta":{"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null},"usage":{"input_tokens":5550,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2574,"cache_read_input_tokens":48608,"output_tokens":2979,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":799},"iterations":[{"input_tokens":5550,"output_tokens":2979,"cache_read_input_tokens":48608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2574,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2574,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2574}},"context_management":{"applied_edits":[]}},{"type":"message_stop"}]